{# ── features: the manifest ── #}
<section id="features" class="border-b v2-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="v2-mono text-xs v2-go mb-4">[01–06] CAPABILITIES</p>
    <h2 class="v2-mono font-bold text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-10">Everything between<br />your code and the model.</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-px sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[01]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Automatic fallback</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">Rate limits, outages, overloads — the request falls through your chain until someone answers. The client never knows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[02]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Mid-stream recovery</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">A stream that dies halfway is re-issued on the next provider and keeps streaming — no broken messages, no lost tool state.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[03]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Context-overflow reroute</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">Every provider reports overflow differently. All of them are detected and rerouted to a model with a bigger window.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[04]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Replay &amp; compare</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">Re-run any logged request on a different model and diff the answers side by side. Audition cheaper models on real traffic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[05]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Subscriptions as keys</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">Route through Claude Max, ChatGPT Pro, Kimi Code, or z.ai Coding plans next to API keys — and fall back when quotas dry up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-cell">
        <p class="v2-cell-num v2-mono text-xs v2-dim transition-colors">[06]</p>
        <h3 class="v2-mono font-semibold mt-3 mb-2">Flight recorder</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed v2-dim">Sessions, recordings, fallback traces, latency and cache analytics — every request your agent ever made, inspectable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

